[36m(TaskRunner pid=547078)[0m code='\nfrom typing import Union\n\ndef sum_difference(n: int) -> int:\n    """\n    Calculate the difference between the square of the sum of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the squares of the first n natural numbers.\n    \n    Args:\n        n (int): The number of natural numbers to consider.\n        \n    Returns:\n        int: The computed difference.\n    """\n    # Calculate the sum of the first n natural numbers\n    sum_n = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    # Calculate the square of the sum\n    sum_sq = sum_n ** 2\n    # Calculate the sum of squares of the first n natural numbers\n    sum_squares = n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1) // 6\n    # Return the difference\n    return sum_sq - sum_squares\n\n# Create solution.py file if it does not exist\n!touch experiments/solution.py\n\n# Write the function into solution.py\n!echo "from typing import Union\\n\\ndef sum_difference(n: int) -> int:\\n    \\"\\"\\n    Calculate the difference between the square of the sum of the first n natural numbers\\n    and the sum of the squares of the first n natural numbers.\\n\\n    Args:\\n        n (int): The number of natural numbers to consider.\\n\\n    Returns:\\n        int: The computed difference.\\n    \\n    # Calculate the sum of the first n natural numbers\\n    sum_n = n * (n + 1) // 2\\n    # Calculate the square of the sum\\n    sum_sq = sum_n ** 2\\n    # Calculate the sum of squares of the first n natural numbers\\n    sum_squares = n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1) // 6\\n    # Return the difference\\n    return sum_sq - sum_squares\\n\\"" >> experiments/solution.py\n'
